WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:03.879
<i>[sweeping orchestral music]</i>
<i>[席卷管弦乐]</i>

00:03.948 --> 00:10.224
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.293 --> 00:12.948
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:13.017 --> 00:14.362
[animal sounds]
[动物的声音]

00:14.431 --> 00:16.844
Hello, animal control.
你好，动物管理局。

00:16.913 --> 00:17.707
Ew.
呃。

00:17.775 --> 00:19.672
SpongeBob, I appreciate
海绵宝宝，我欣赏

00:19.741 --> 00:22.155
you volunteering here
at the animal shelter,
你在这里做志愿者
在动物收容所，

00:22.224 --> 00:25.603
but could you please stop
letting the worms
但你能停下来吗
让蠕虫

00:25.672 --> 00:28.844
use the phone?
使用电话？

00:28.913 --> 00:31.431
Oh, I told them no more
takeout calls.
哦，我不再告诉他们了
叫外卖。

00:33.189 --> 00:34.362
[belches]
[打嗝]

00:34.431 --> 00:35.672
[groans]
[呻吟]

00:35.741 --> 00:37.913
Now, how can I help you?
现在，我能帮你什么忙？

00:37.982 --> 00:40.810
There's a worm
somewhere outside my house,
有一条虫子
我家外面的某个地方，

00:40.879 --> 00:42.534
and it won't stop barking.
它不会停止吠叫。

00:42.603 --> 00:44.258
I'll get on that right away.
我会立即着手处理。

00:44.327 --> 00:48.327
[animal sounds]
[动物的声音]

00:48.396 --> 00:49.844
I gotta go catch a stray.
我得去抓一只流浪狗。

00:49.913 --> 00:52.120
SpongeBob, you hold down
the fort.
海绵宝宝，你按住
堡垒。

00:52.189 --> 00:53.396
Sir, yes, sir.
先生，是的，先生。

00:53.465 --> 00:54.820
I will take care
of these wild worms
我会照顾的
这些野生蠕虫

00:54.844 --> 00:56.569
to the best of my ability.
尽我所能。

00:58.982 --> 01:01.017
[laughs]
[笑]

01:01.603 --> 01:02.534
[sighs]
[叹气]

01:02.603 --> 01:05.465
[laughing]
[笑]

01:07.258 --> 01:10.500
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

01:11.465 --> 01:14.189
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

01:14.258 --> 01:15.431
[gasps]
- Uh-oh.
[喘气]
- 呃哦。

01:15.500 --> 01:17.224
B-B-Butcher's cage.
B-B-屠夫的笼子。

01:17.293 --> 01:20.051
[nervous whimpering]
[紧张的呜咽]

01:22.913 --> 01:25.258
- [barks]
- [screams]
- [吠叫]
- [尖叫]

01:29.017 --> 01:30.086
Butcher?
屠夫？

01:30.155 --> 01:32.327
I know you're really a good boy.
我知道你真的是一个好孩子。

01:32.396 --> 01:34.017
Just let me pet you,
就让我宠你吧

01:34.086 --> 01:35.224
real gentle.
真的很温柔。

01:35.293 --> 01:36.775
That a boy.
那是个男孩。

01:36.844 --> 01:39.258
[growls and snarls]
[咆哮和咆哮]

01:39.327 --> 01:40.672
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:40.741 --> 01:44.017
I hope he doesn't develop
a taste for sponge.
希望他不要发展
海绵的味道。

01:44.086 --> 01:45.948
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:49.293 --> 01:51.155
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

01:51.224 --> 01:52.707
[animal sounds]
[动物的声音]

01:52.775 --> 01:55.431
[straining]
[紧张]

01:55.500 --> 01:56.500
[barking]
[叫声]

01:56.534 --> 01:58.534
Whoa... whoa!
哇...哇！

01:58.603 --> 02:01.534
- [barking]
- Whoa-whoa.
- [吠叫]
- 哇哇。

02:03.189 --> 02:05.086
[barking]
[叫声]

02:07.638 --> 02:10.810
Patrick.
帕特里克.

02:10.879 --> 02:13.396
Yeah, aw... who's a good boy?
是啊，噢……谁是个好孩子？

02:13.465 --> 02:14.707
Who's a good boy?
谁是好孩子？

02:14.775 --> 02:16.603
[panting]
Huh?
[气喘吁吁]
啊？

02:18.982 --> 02:20.293
Patrick's my friend.
帕特里克是我的朋友。

02:20.362 --> 02:22.638
Sometimes if he's eaten
worm food by mistake,
有时候如果他吃饱了
错误地喂食蠕虫，

02:22.707 --> 02:24.500
he's goes into worm mode.
他进入了蠕虫模式。

02:24.569 --> 02:25.844
[growls]
[咆哮]

02:25.913 --> 02:27.775
There's no telling how long
it'll last.
不知道要多久
它会持续下去。

02:27.844 --> 02:30.086
Well, if he's not trained
in a few days
好吧，如果他没有受过训练
几天后

02:30.155 --> 02:33.155
so he can be adopted,
he'll have to be locked up,
这样他就可以被收养
他必须被关起来

02:33.224 --> 02:35.120
like Butcher.
就像屠夫一样。

02:35.189 --> 02:37.224
[growls]
[咆哮]

02:37.293 --> 02:38.465
Don't worry, sir.
别担心，先生。

02:38.534 --> 02:40.603
I'll train him.
He's already housebroken.
我会训练他。
他已经家破人亡了。

02:40.672 --> 02:43.017
[liquid trickling]
[液体滴落]

02:43.086 --> 02:45.500
[nervous laughs]
I knew he was broken.
[紧张的笑声]
我知道他已经崩溃了。

02:45.569 --> 02:47.465
I thought it was house.
我还以为是房子呢

02:47.534 --> 02:50.051
Uh...
呃...

02:50.293 --> 02:51.224
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

02:51.293 --> 02:52.603
Now, Patrick,
现在，帕特里克，

02:52.672 --> 02:55.189
every good worm needs to learn
how to do tricks.
每只优秀的蠕虫都需要学习
如何做技巧。

02:55.258 --> 02:58.017
Then they get wormy treats
as a reward.
然后他们会得到蠕虫食物
作为奖励。

02:58.086 --> 02:59.086
Sit.
坐。

02:59.155 --> 03:00.879
[excited barks]
[兴奋的吠叫]

03:04.155 --> 03:05.327
Um... almost.
嗯……差不多了。

03:05.396 --> 03:07.051
Let's try another one.
让我们尝试另一个。

03:07.120 --> 03:08.189
Shake.
摇。

03:08.258 --> 03:10.396
[excited barks]
[兴奋的吠叫]

03:11.638 --> 03:13.603
[pants]
- Shall we try roll over?
[裤子]
- 我们要尝试翻身吗？

03:13.672 --> 03:16.396
[excited barks]
[兴奋的吠叫]

03:16.465 --> 03:18.500
Patrick, wait.
帕特里克，等等。

03:18.569 --> 03:20.603
[crashing]
[崩溃]

03:20.672 --> 03:23.603
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

03:23.672 --> 03:26.362
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:26.431 --> 03:33.258
Rolling Star Express,
right on time.
滚星快车，
准时。

03:33.327 --> 03:34.672
[pants]
[裤子]

03:34.741 --> 03:37.534
I know one wormy
that needs a bath.
我认识一只虫子
需要洗澡。

03:37.603 --> 03:39.051
[growls]
[咆哮]

03:39.120 --> 03:42.534
Okay, okay, no bath, no bath.
好了好了，不洗澡了，不洗澡了。

03:42.603 --> 03:43.741
Here, Patrick.
在这里，帕特里克。

03:43.810 --> 03:46.844
Worms learn from other worms.
蠕虫向其他蠕虫学习。

03:46.913 --> 03:48.603
They'll show you
how to be a good boy.
他们会告诉你
如何做一个好孩子。

03:48.672 --> 03:51.396
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

03:51.465 --> 03:53.327
Hmm?
唔？

03:53.396 --> 03:57.293
[sophisticated barks]
[复杂的吠叫]

04:04.465 --> 04:06.362
[cheers]
[干杯]

04:06.431 --> 04:07.362
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:07.431 --> 04:10.500
[barks]
[吠叫]

04:10.775 --> 04:12.293
Huh?
啊？

04:12.362 --> 04:14.327
This worm is a menace.
这种蠕虫是一种威胁。

04:14.396 --> 04:16.672
I'm afraid he'll have to be
locked up,
恐怕他必须是
被锁起来,

04:16.741 --> 04:17.810
like Butcher.
就像屠夫一样。

04:17.879 --> 04:19.431
Please don't do that.
请不要这样做。

04:19.500 --> 04:21.810
I'll adopt him.
I'll take him home.
我会收养他。
我会带他回家。

04:21.879 --> 04:23.224
He'll be my rescue.
他会是我的拯救者。

04:23.293 --> 04:26.844
And you'll take full
responsibility for him?
而你将充分
对他负责？

04:26.913 --> 04:28.707
- [pants]
- I promise.
- [裤子]
- 我保证。

04:28.775 --> 04:30.120
Well, that's good.
嗯，那很好。

04:30.189 --> 04:32.741
I really didn't want to have
to fix him, anyway.
我真的不想拥有
无论如何，要修复他。

04:32.810 --> 04:34.362
[excited barks]
[兴奋的吠叫]

04:34.431 --> 04:36.534
Thank you, thank you.
谢谢，谢谢。

04:36.603 --> 04:38.362
Patrick, whoa, boy.
帕特里克，哇，男孩。

04:38.431 --> 04:40.500
Heel.
脚跟。

04:40.569 --> 04:42.741
Sorry.
对不起。

04:42.810 --> 04:44.396
Oh, Gary...
哦，加里...

04:44.465 --> 04:46.741
I brought you a playmate.
我给你带来了一个玩伴。

04:46.810 --> 04:47.741
[meows]
[喵喵]

04:47.810 --> 04:49.086
[barks]
[吠叫]

04:49.155 --> 04:52.500
- [screeches]
- [barks]
- [尖叫声]
- [吠叫]

04:52.569 --> 04:54.534
[animal sounds]
[动物的声音]

04:54.603 --> 04:57.534
Patrick, Gary, no, stop.
帕特里克，加里，不，停下来。

04:57.603 --> 04:59.707
[barking]
[叫声]

04:59.775 --> 05:02.017
Hmm?
唔？

05:02.603 --> 05:05.362
[meows]
[喵喵]

05:05.431 --> 05:06.500
[barking]
[叫声]

05:06.569 --> 05:09.465
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

05:11.603 --> 05:13.224
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

05:13.293 --> 05:15.879
[barking]
[叫声]

05:15.948 --> 05:18.569
[rooster crows]
[公鸡打鸣]

05:18.638 --> 05:21.189
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

05:21.258 --> 05:23.638
[pounds on door]
[敲门]

05:23.707 --> 05:25.017
Come on.
快点。

05:25.086 --> 05:26.638
[groans]
I'm sorry.
[呻吟]
对不起。

05:26.707 --> 05:29.155
Was the noise bothering you?
噪音打扰到您了吗？

05:29.224 --> 05:32.741
[barking]
[叫声]

05:32.810 --> 05:33.810
<i>[energized music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

05:33.879 --> 05:35.362
Patrick, heel.
帕特里克，脚后跟。

05:35.431 --> 05:36.741
[yells]
[喊叫]

05:36.810 --> 05:39.534
[barking]
[叫声]

05:39.603 --> 05:43.155
[gasping]
[喘气]

05:43.224 --> 05:45.086
Jeez.
天啊。

05:45.155 --> 05:47.431
[meows]
[喵喵]

05:47.500 --> 05:48.913
Huh. Look.
呵呵。看。

05:48.982 --> 05:51.672
I don't care what kind
of weird and stupid parties
我不在乎什么样的
奇怪而愚蠢的派对

05:51.741 --> 05:55.741
you throw, I'm just asking that
you keep your pet quiet.
你扔，我只是问这个
你让你的宠物保持安静。

05:55.810 --> 05:57.224
I am at my wit's end.
我已经无计可施了。

05:57.293 --> 05:59.120
Patrick is in worm mode again.
帕特里克再次进入蠕虫模式。

05:59.189 --> 06:01.431
But this time,
he's out of control.
但这一次，
他失控了。

06:01.500 --> 06:03.638
Oh, any worm can be tamed.
哦，任何蠕虫都可以被驯服。

06:03.707 --> 06:06.017
Even one as dumb as Patrick.
即使像帕特里克这样愚蠢的人也是如此。

06:06.086 --> 06:09.017
He just needs tough love.
他只是需要严厉的爱。

06:09.086 --> 06:12.327
Would you tough-love Patrick,
Squidward?
你会严厉地爱帕特里克吗？
章鱼哥？

06:12.396 --> 06:13.948
No way.
决不。

06:14.017 --> 06:16.465
[barking]
[叫声]

06:16.534 --> 06:17.741
Please, Squidward.
求你了，章鱼哥。

06:17.810 --> 06:20.362
I bet you're the best
worm trainer ever.
我打赌你是最好的
曾经的蠕虫训练师。

06:20.431 --> 06:21.431
Please.
请。

06:21.465 --> 06:22.362
[laughs]
[笑]

06:22.431 --> 06:23.707
Beg me.
求我吧。

06:23.775 --> 06:25.396
[barks]
[吠叫]

06:27.948 --> 06:32.189
Okay, sit.
好吧，坐吧。

06:32.258 --> 06:33.258
Huh?
啊？

06:33.293 --> 06:35.293
Well, I'm a good idiot trainer.
嗯，我是一个很好的白痴教练。

06:35.362 --> 06:38.500
And since Patrick's an idiot...
既然帕特里克是个白痴......

06:38.569 --> 06:40.569
Okay, I'll train him.
好的，我会训练他。

06:40.638 --> 06:42.741
But only if you play dead...
但前提是你装死...

06:42.810 --> 06:44.155
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:44.224 --> 06:47.258
[laughs]
And stay playing dead.
[笑]
并继续装死。

06:47.327 --> 06:49.638
I've got an idiot to train.
我有一个白痴要训练。

06:49.707 --> 06:52.327
<i>[playful tone]</i>
<i>[俏皮的语气]</i>

06:52.396 --> 06:54.810
[straining]
[紧张]

06:54.879 --> 06:56.810
We'll start with something simple.
我们将从简单的事情开始。

06:56.879 --> 06:58.982
I'll teach you how to heel.
我来教你如何跟好。

06:59.051 --> 07:01.569
Now... be a good boy.
现在...做一个好孩子。

07:01.638 --> 07:02.569
[growls]
[咆哮]

07:02.638 --> 07:03.948
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:04.017 --> 07:05.672
Heel... stop!
脚后跟……停下来！

07:05.741 --> 07:09.913
Heel.
- [growls]
脚跟。
- [咆哮]

07:09.982 --> 07:12.155
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

07:12.224 --> 07:14.913
All right, that's it.
好吧，就是这样。

07:14.982 --> 07:17.258
<i>[energized music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

07:17.327 --> 07:19.327
[pants]
[裤子]

07:24.017 --> 07:26.672
Have a nice life.
祝你生活愉快。

07:27.913 --> 07:30.879
[coyote howls]
[土狼嚎叫]

07:31.879 --> 07:33.293
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

07:33.362 --> 07:34.741
- [hums]
- Hi, Squidward.
- [哼哼]
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

07:34.810 --> 07:37.224
I'm still playing dead.
[laughs]
我还在装死。
[笑]

07:37.293 --> 07:39.569
[hums]
[哼哼]

07:39.638 --> 07:42.120
Tough love.
[laughs]
艰难的爱。
[笑]

07:42.189 --> 07:44.844
Huh?
[pounding on door]
啊？
[敲门]

07:44.913 --> 07:46.948
[pants]
[裤子]

07:47.017 --> 07:49.155
[winces]
[退缩]

07:49.224 --> 07:51.948
<i>[playful tone]</i>
<i>[俏皮的语气]</i>

07:52.017 --> 07:54.155
This, my little barking friend,
这个，我的小吠叫朋友，

07:54.224 --> 07:56.120
is a shock collar.
是一个防震项圈。

07:58.051 --> 08:01.431
Whenever you bark,
I'll push this button
每当你吠叫时，
我会按下这个按钮

08:01.500 --> 08:05.638
and give you
a mild tough-love shock.
并给你
一种温和的严厉的爱的冲击。

08:05.707 --> 08:08.810
[pants]
[裤子]

08:08.879 --> 08:11.431
Hmm?
唔？

08:11.500 --> 08:14.465
Nothing?
没有什么？

08:14.534 --> 08:16.500
Oh, it must be broken.
哦，一定是坏掉了。

08:16.569 --> 08:19.672
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:19.741 --> 08:21.948
Nuts.
坚果。

08:22.017 --> 08:24.672
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:25.913 --> 08:28.810
[barks]
[吠叫]

08:28.879 --> 08:31.810
<i>[energized music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

08:31.879 --> 08:35.258
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:35.431 --> 08:38.017
[barks]
[吠叫]

08:38.775 --> 08:40.741
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

08:40.810 --> 08:42.741
Still playing dead.
还装死。

08:42.810 --> 08:46.396
[mutters]
[嘀咕]

08:46.465 --> 08:47.775
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:47.844 --> 08:50.465
- [growls]
- [nervous whimper]
- [咆哮]
- [紧张的呜咽]

08:50.534 --> 08:53.948
<i>[energized music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

08:54.017 --> 08:55.189
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:55.258 --> 08:57.913
- Oh.
- [barks]
- 哦。
- [吠叫]

08:58.844 --> 09:00.672
[pants]
[裤子]

09:00.741 --> 09:03.707
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

09:03.775 --> 09:06.810
[pants]
[裤子]

09:06.879 --> 09:10.500
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

09:13.086 --> 09:14.569
[barks]
[吠叫]

09:14.638 --> 09:16.500
Excuse, Mr. Squidward.
对不起，章鱼哥先生。

09:16.569 --> 09:18.948
SpongeBob tells me
that you've trained Patrick
海绵宝宝告诉我
你训练过帕特里克

09:19.017 --> 09:20.362
using tough love.
用严厉的爱。

09:20.431 --> 09:22.913
Patrick? He's impossible.
帕特里克？他是不可能的。

09:22.982 --> 09:24.638
I've tried to get him to sit...
我试着让他坐下...

09:24.707 --> 09:26.569
[barks]
[吠叫]

09:26.638 --> 09:27.913
Hmm...
唔...

09:27.982 --> 09:31.741
Okay, well, then I tried to get
him to beg...
好吧，然后我尝试着
他求...

09:31.810 --> 09:33.775
[pants]
[裤子]

09:33.844 --> 09:35.534
Spin.
旋转。

09:35.603 --> 09:36.707
Now shake.
现在摇一摇。

09:36.775 --> 09:38.948
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:39.017 --> 09:40.155
Cheerleader split.
啦啦队长分裂。

09:40.224 --> 09:41.431
<i>[fanfare]</i>
<i>[大张旗鼓]</i>

09:41.500 --> 09:42.913
- Chicken.
- [chicken sounds]
- 鸡。
- [鸡的声音]

09:42.982 --> 09:44.569
Chicken nugget.
鸡块。

09:44.638 --> 09:45.741
Air guitar.
空气吉他.

09:45.810 --> 09:48.879
<i>[rock music]</i>
<i>[摇滚乐]</i>

09:48.948 --> 09:50.086
[pants]
[裤子]

09:50.155 --> 09:52.155
[laughs]
[笑]

09:52.224 --> 09:54.569
Now play dead.
现在装死。

09:54.638 --> 09:57.500
What? You did it.
什么？你做到了。

09:57.569 --> 09:59.396
You're a miracle worker.
你是一个创造奇迹的人。

09:59.465 --> 10:02.051
Well, I don't like to brag,
but...
嗯，我不喜欢炫耀，
但是...

10:02.120 --> 10:03.465
That's great.
那太棒了。

10:03.534 --> 10:05.844
We've got a problem worm
that needs training.
我们遇到了一个有问题的蠕虫
需要培训。

10:05.913 --> 10:06.844
- What?
- [whistles]
- 什么？
- [口哨]

10:06.913 --> 10:08.327
Bring him in, fellas!
把他带进来吧，伙计们！

10:08.396 --> 10:11.465
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

10:11.534 --> 10:12.879
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:12.948 --> 10:15.155
Say hello to Butcher.
向屠夫问好。

10:15.224 --> 10:17.189
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:17.258 --> 10:18.534
[animal sounds]
[动物的声音]

10:18.603 --> 10:19.810
Heel, heel!
脚跟，脚跟！

10:19.879 --> 10:24.224
Ah, stop... heel, heel...
fetch, heel, heel!
啊，停下来……脚跟，脚跟……
拿来，脚后跟，脚后跟！

10:24.293 --> 10:26.603
Hey, you're not a worm anymore.
嘿，你不再是一条虫子了。

10:26.672 --> 10:30.017
Nah, I snapped out of it
hours ago.
不，我突然醒悟了
几个小时前。

10:30.086 --> 10:33.189
I just wanted Squidward to feel
like he did a good job.
我只是想让章鱼哥感觉到
就像他做得很好一样。

10:33.258 --> 10:34.569
All right, that's enough.
好吧，够了。

10:34.638 --> 10:36.062
I'll teach you!
- Yeah, I hope Squidward's
我来教你！
- 是的，我希望是章鱼哥的

10:36.086 --> 10:37.786
not too tough on him.
- Will you sit... good dog sit.
对他不太严厉。
- 你愿意坐吗...好狗坐。

10:37.810 --> 10:40.017
Will you sit? No... don't.
你会坐吗？不……不要。

10:40.086 --> 10:41.810
Good afternoon, gentlemen.
下午好，先生们。

10:41.879 --> 10:44.396
Nice day for a walk.
散步的好日子。

10:46.051 --> 10:47.465
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

[两人都喘气]